# Text is checked out with LF line endings on every platform, Windows included: tests and
# golden vectors compare bytes, and the configuration examples are edited by line (ADR 0042).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Batch files need CRLF; the generated Gradle wrapper properties are kept as they are.
*.bat text eol=crlf
bindings/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties -text
